					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400680904
					],
					"speakerTitle": "火炽之心"
				},
				{
					"id": 400680904,
					"content": "咿啊啊啊啊它会说话！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400680905,
						400680906
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400680905,
					"content": "昨天松鼠也说话了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400680907
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400680907,
					"content": "我知道啦！但、但就是不一样嘛…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400680908
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400680908,
					"content": "您好，我们触摸了外面海滩上那些长得像鼓一样的植物，就被送到这一带来。请问您是这里的主人吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400680909
					],
					"speakerTitle": "辛焱"
				},
				{
					"id": 400680909,
					"content": "这里是音乐的殿堂，我不过是区区守门者。朋友们，你们也是来追求极致音乐的吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400680910
					],
					"speakerTitle": "火炽之心"
				},
				{
					"id": 400680910,
					"content": "没错。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400680911
					],
					"speakerTitle": "辛焱"
				},
				{
					"id": 400680911,
					"content": "那么，你对音乐的寄托是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400680912
					],
					"speakerTitle": "火炽之心"
				},
				{
					"id": 400680912,
					"content": "为反抗高歌！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400680913
					],
					"speakerTitle": "辛焱"
				},
				{
					"id": 400680913,
					"content": "你很懂嘛！太好了，能遇到知己，我可真有福气。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400680914
					],
					"speakerTitle": "火炽之心"
				},
				{
					"id": 400680914,
					"content": "跟奇怪的花都这么投缘…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400680915
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400680915,
					"content": "好相处的人，走到哪里都有很多朋友呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400680916
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 400680916,
					"content": "你们能走到这里，一定是想进入更深层的殿堂。不过很抱歉，进入殿堂需要我的歌喉，而我现在嗓子有点哑…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400680917
					],
					"speakerTitle": "火炽之心"
				},
				{
					"id": 400680917,
					"content": "你不要紧吧？要不要，呃，喝点驱寒的药？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400680918
					],
					"speakerTitle": "辛焱"
				},
				{
					"id": 400680918,
					"content": "不，我只是太久没喝「寒山甘泉」了。只要喝到那个，我就能重振歌喉，为你们打开道路。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400680919
					],
					"speakerTitle": "火炽之心"
				},
				{
					"id": 400680919,
					"content": "「寒山甘泉」？是泉水的名字？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400680920
					],
					"speakerTitle": "辛焱"
				},
				{
					"id": 400680920,
					"content": "对。只要喝下那种水，疲惫的大人，困倦的小鸟，无知的孩童…所有人都能唱出最优美的歌声。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400680921
					],
					"speakerTitle": "火炽之心"
				},
