					"id": 400680921,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400680922
					],
					"speakerTitle": "辛焱"
				},
				{
					"id": 400680922,
					"content": "好，我帮你找。你把泉水的所在地告诉我。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400680923
					],
					"speakerTitle": "辛焱"
				},
				{
					"id": 400680923,
					"content": "谢谢你！清澈的水令植物生长，它们变得茁壮，克服困难攀上高山…泉水，就在那些被植被庇护的山上。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400680924
					],
					"speakerTitle": "火炽之心"
				},
				{
					"id": 400680924,
					"content": "原来是上山啊！我还以为随便打点海水就行。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400680925
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400680925,
					"content": "山泉跟海水完全是两种东西吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400680926
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 400680926,
					"content": "只不过，想要看到那样的山泉，或许得靠我的力量。这位朋友，把手给我，这样你就能看到我所看见的事物。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400680927
					],
					"speakerTitle": "火炽之心"
				},
				{
					"id": 400680927,
					"content": "握了我的手，就是结交我这个朋友了哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "辛焱"
				},
				{
					"id": 400680906,
					"content": "昨天船也说话了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400680907
					]
				}
			]
